---
// High Tech Facility: bloques en zigzag (texto/media alternados) con fondos
// blanco / rojo / beige. Cada equipo tiene ancla para enlazar desde el home.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import ZigzagSection from '../components/ZigzagSection.astro';
import VideoEmbed from '../components/VideoEmbed.astro';
import ContactCta from '../components/ContactCta.astro';

const IMG = '/images/tech';
const FOTONA_VIDEO = 'https://562endodontics.com/wp-content/uploads/338491871_1417227822442679_7795680675852427648_n.mp4';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="High Tech Facility"
  description="At 562 endodontics we utilize advanced materials and equipment designed to help with accurate diagnosis and make your treatment more comfortable and efficient."
>
  <PageHero title="High Tech Facility" image={`${IMG}/hero.jpg`} />

  <!-- S2: Explore our technology -->
  <ZigzagSection gridCols="md:grid-cols-[38fr_62fr]">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-brand-rust sm:text-[32px]">Explore our technology</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-brand-ink/80">
      At 562 endodontics we utilize advanced materials and equipment designed to help with accurate diagnosis and make
      your treatment more comfortable and efficient
    </p>
    <img slot="media" src={`${IMG}/explore-technology.jpg`} alt="Endodontic technology at 562 endodontics" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-[440px] rounded-[20px] shadow-md" loading="lazy" />
  </ZigzagSection>

  <!-- S3: GentleWave (banda roja) -->
  <ZigzagSection id="gentlewave" bg="bg-brand-rust" reverse gridCols="md:grid-cols-[46fr_54fr]">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-[#E3DBD4] sm:text-[32px]">The GentleWave</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-white">
      The GentleWave Procedure is a high-tech fluid delivery system that uses gentle waves of energy to distribute
      disinfecting fluids throughout the root canal system while preserving tooth structure. It is a minimally-invasive
      alternative to traditional techniques. In more simple words, the Gentlewave is like doing a "power-wash" inside
      your tooth to eliminate bacteria and biofilm causing infection.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 inline-block rounded-[20px] bg-white p-4">
      <img src={`${IMG}/gentle-wave-logo.webp`} alt="GentleWave" class="h-auto w-[226px]" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div slot="media" class="rounded-[20px] bg-white p-4">
      <VideoEmbed youtube="jG12YTYbnEI" title="The GentleWave Procedure" />
    </div>
  </ZigzagSection>

  <!-- S4: Skypulse Fotona Laser -->
  <ZigzagSection id="fotona" reverse gridCols="md:grid-cols-[40fr_60fr]">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-brand-rust sm:text-[32px]">Skypulse Fotona Laser</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-brand-ink/80">
      Fotona's SSP and SWEEPS® laser treatment offers an innovative and fast disinfection solution that is minimally
      invasive and highly effective
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 rounded-[20px] bg-white p-3 shadow-md">
      <VideoEmbed mp4={FOTONA_VIDEO} poster={`${IMG}/fotona-poster.png`} title="Skypulse Fotona Laser" />
    </div>
    <img slot="media" src={`${IMG}/fotona-laser.jpg`} alt="Fotona Skypulse laser in the 562 endodontics clinic" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-[446px] rounded-[20px] shadow-md" loading="lazy" />
  </ZigzagSection>

  <!-- S5: QuickSleeper -->
  <ZigzagSection id="quicksleeper" bg="bg-[#E3DBD4]" gridCols="md:grid-cols-[43fr_57fr]">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-brand-rust sm:text-[32px]">QuickSleeper</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-brand-ink/80">
      QuickSleeper is our technique of choice because it is highly effective with a low amount of anesthetic. it is very
      easy to use, and our patients always report feeling comfortable during and after the procedure.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-brand-ink/80">
      The device allows us to directly deposit the anesthetic beside the tooth, avoiding multiple injections and the
      risk of not getting profound anesthesia.
    </p>
    <div slot="media" class="space-y-4 rounded-[20px] bg-white p-4 shadow-md">
      <img src={`${IMG}/quicksleeper-product.png`} alt="The QuickSleeper 5 computer-controlled local anesthesia system" class="h-auto w-full rounded-[12px]" loading="lazy" />
      <VideoEmbed youtube="cx_-pYKf5KA" title="QuickSleeper 5" />
    </div>
  </ZigzagSection>

  <!-- S6: Dental CT Scan -->
  <ZigzagSection id="cbct" reverse gridCols="md:grid-cols-[40fr_60fr]">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-brand-rust sm:text-[32px]">Dental CT Scan (CBCT)</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-brand-ink/80">
      CBCT technology has changed the field of dental imaging. This diagnostic tool provides high-resolution, 3D scans
      of teeth, jaws and facial structures with low radiation exposure to the patient. As a result, CBCT is an ideal tool
      for diagnosing and planning treatment with precision. For example, with a CBCT scan, you can get detailed
      information about your teeth, locate and extend any infection, and assess the surrounding tissues without
      undergoing costly or unnecessary treatment.
    </p>
    <img slot="media" src="/images/treatments/dental-trauma/cbct.jpg" alt="CBCT imaging unit with touchscreen" class="h-auto w-full rounded-[20px] shadow-md" loading="lazy" />
  </ZigzagSection>

  <!-- S7: Microscopios -->
  <ZigzagSection id="microscopes" bg="bg-[#E3DBD4]" gridCols="md:grid-cols-[52fr_48fr]">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-brand-rust sm:text-[32px]">Surgical Operating Microscopes</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-brand-ink/80">
      The operating microscope significantly improves a clinician's ability to view the tiniest details inside a
      patient's tooth. With a dental microscope, the vision is magnified up to 25 times that of the naked eye, the dental
      microscope is useful in both diagnosis and treatment as we can preserve tooth structure, visualized cracks and
      canal anatomy that otherwise would be missed.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-brand-ink/80">Research demonstrates better outcomes compared to treatment without magnification.</p>
    <img slot="media" src="/images/treatments/root-canal/step-2.jpg" alt="Dental operating microscope" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-[510px] rounded-[20px] shadow-md" loading="lazy" />
  </ZigzagSection>

  <ContactCta />
</BaseLayout>
